  The slides_spec says the 13 hundis were 'திறக்கப்பட்டன' and the reel says 'மேலும் செய்திகளுக்கு...' fine, but slide 3 'எப்போது எண்ணினர்?' states the counting was a Tuesday morning-to-evening event; the article only says the hundis were opened on Tuesday and counting ran from 10 am to 7 pm, so this is acceptable, yet slide 2 asserts 'நாமக்கல் நகரின் மையப் பகுதியில் அமைந்துள்ளன' as a statement about the 13 hundis rather than the temples.
